lips County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 248% of normal in August to September and 60% in April to May. So far in 2026, the middle of the grids sits at 26% of normal for January to February and 44% for March to April. Grid 24711 and grid 24712 each had their driest year in 2012 at 56%.</p>"}
